  "description": "Crossed Wedding Rings Embroidery\nThis embroidery design showcases two interlocked wedding rings with a lovely red heart above them. The “Entwined Hearts” design represents the eternal bond between two souls deeply in love. The crossed alliance symbolizes unity and commitment, while the red heart adds a touch of romance and passion. Stitch this beautiful motif onto any fabric to create a heartfelt expression of everlasting love.\nThis machine embroidery design comes with multiple embroidery file formats and can be used with multiple embroidery machines.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Crossed Wedding Rings Embroidery</p>\n<p>This embroidery design showcases two interlocked wedding rings with a lovely red heart above them. The “Entwined Hearts” design represents the eternal bond between two souls deeply in love. The crossed alliance symbolizes unity and commitment, while the red heart adds a touch of romance and passion. Stitch this beautiful motif onto any fabric to create a heartfelt expression of everlasting love.</p>\n<p>This machine embroidery design comes with multiple embroidery file formats and can be used with multiple embroidery machines.</p>",
